.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH dalgon-dev 1  "dalgon-dev " 
.SH NAME
dalgon\-dev \- Inspect and drive sessions for debugging.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgon dev\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect and drive sessions for debugging.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dalgon\-dev\-run(1)
Drive a scripted headless session from a scenario file (one step JSON per line).
.TP
dalgon\-dev\-journal(1)
Replay, diff, and edit session journals.
.TP
dalgon\-dev\-fold(1)
Print which folded fields each journal record changes.
.TP
dalgon\-dev\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
